  "description": "Saddle up for a retro adventure with this set of 16 unique digital papers featuring vintage pop-art women dressed as cowgirls, inspired by 1950s comic books.\nThese high-resolution PNGs are sized at 3600 x 3600 pixels and 300 DPI, making them perfect for adding a touch of wild west charm to your creative projects.\nIdeal for crafting cards, scrapbooks, junk journals, and more, these papers bring a playful and bold twist to your designs.\nUse them to create eye-catching pieces that combine vintage flair with cowgirl spirit.",
